OL,3,GNEWSAMen attacked by group in city
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter two men were attacked in
OL,8,FNottingham city centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the men, 37
OL,11,Fand 33, were believed to have been
OL,12,Fassaulted by a group of five men, near
OL,13,Fthe Food Factory takeaway in Lower
OL,14,FParliament Street, shortly before 05:00
OL,15,FGMT on Sunday.
OL,17,FThe injured men were taken to hospital
OL,18,Fby paramedics for injuries the police
OL,19,Fsaid were "not believed to be
OL,20,Flife-altering".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
